   "lines": [
    "Rained all day so",
    "we stayed in camp",
    "- reading, playing",
    "euchre and whist",
    "and practising with",
    "our rifles. I again",
    "waited a couple of",
    "hours for ducks,",
    "getting one long",
    "and unsuccessful",
    "shot. I killed",
    "a bat and a",
    "nighthawk."
   ],
